  "assemblyNote": "Coupon B is a complete horizontal NEMA8 retention and transmission fit assembly. The two M1 16T miter gears, M1 16T output pinion, saddle, two clamp straps, bearing housing/cap, guide shoes, fin, fit gauges, and 24T ring arc are printed. The motor, both shafts, two MR84 bearings, screws, nuts, heat-set inserts, pins, washers, and shaft collar are purchased and are excluded from the printable-only 3MF.",
  "coordinateSystem": "XY clock plane; +Z viewer; angle-zero station on +X",
  "declaredContacts": [
    "output shaft D-flat to output-pinion D-bore",
